      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PhilstarNews/status/2000053484083925478",
      "text": "Metro Manila traffic is no longer just an inconvenience. It is a national crisis. 🚦\n\nIn his latest “Babe’s Eye View”, Philippine Ambassador to the US Jose Manuel “Babe” Romualdez asks a tough question: What is the long-term cost of doing nothing?\n\nLooking at how countries like Indonesia tackled over-centralization, he argues that bold, long-term decisions may be the only way forward. Is it time for the Philippines to consider a drastic move too?\n\nRead: https://t.co/ouaxGsxLy9",
